WIDGET&quot;'-4f562f637efe1c91END_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-0209f168a968c8e3END_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">BOOK_UNI_WYR_MatrimonialServiceLetter</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_UNI_WYR_MatrimonialServiceLetter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_UNI_WYR_MatrimonialServiceLetter\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">a788f3c9-2d6b-4fe9-bf82-bd6bfd080cd7</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:a788f3c9-2d6b-4fe9-bf82-bd6bfd080cd7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:a788f3c9-2d6b-4fe9-bf82-bd6bfd080cd7\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Rivington_General\" title=\"Rivington General\">The Rivington General</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-7&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-63</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>Dear Master Angleiron,\n</p><p><br>\nI'm exceedingly sorry to report that we are still unable to find someone who might be willing to meet with you. The men and women of this city can be so awfully picky sometimes. Might I suggest that you try submitting a portrait that presents you in a different light? Not that there's anything wrong with a blacksmith, but I wonder if that might be one of the prejudices that we are unfortunately running into where tastes are concerned. Of course, we won't stop trying to arrange something for you. As we like to say at The Fulfilled Heart, there are no lost souls, only those who've yet to find their home.\n</p><p><br>\nYours, encouragingly,\n</p><p>Maestro Hartstrum.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714214856\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.055 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.058 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1359/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 26366/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7611/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.012/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 931026/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   48.114      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   48.114      1 -total\n 50.93%   24.506      6 Template:Icon_text\n 45.66%   21.970     15 Template:Trim\n 24.43%   11.756      2 Template:Uid\n 15.11%    7.272      1 Template:Main_only\n 13.56%    6.523      2 Template:Template_style\n 10.27%    4.940      6 Template:Ifempty\n  9.53%    4.585      1 Template:Notes\n  8.92%    4.293      1 Template:Icon_link\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:31080-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714214856 and revision id 3